{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"A3 debugging milestone: reproduced full-suite collection failure as ModuleNotFoundError rebar_reconciler.conftest. Root cause was the new integration module importing the production package at collection time before pytest established the unit package namespace. Moved the two production imports inside the test function, matching the established integration convention. Exact full collect-only now succeeds: 9,602/9,793 collected, 191 deselected, zero errors. Also remediated the latest execution-plan BLOCK with concrete oracle fixtures, assertions, delta definition, commands, and rollback controls; fresh review follows."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785785702618877001,"uuid":"63213768-2926-4d17-8132-d80c0272ca88"}